From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: morikon <leafpmpmp@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0800
Subject: media: sophgo: add CV1800/SG2000 VI raw capture

Add a media controller driver for the video input (VI) block. The CSI
bridge writes raw Bayer frames to memory as packed RAW12. The ISP is not
used. A V4L2 control selects the test pattern of the bridge.

After a frame of the wrong size, the bridge drops all frames that follow.
The driver then resets the VI block and continues the stream.
